{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_043F80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Ogopogo是什么？这是哪种语言？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Ogopogo是栖息在加拿大奥肯那根湖的怪兽。既然是当地原住民世代相传的怪兽，名字大概也来自他们的语言。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":142,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"传说吗。实际上……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也留下了文字记录。自1872年首次留下记录以来，进入20世纪后也有过多次目击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这样啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Snake也开始喜欢<R=UMA,UMA>了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=UMA,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"算是吧……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"果然，<R=UMA,UMA>就是男人的浪漫啊。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=UMA,UMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"等尼加拉瓜恢复和平以后，Snake也一起去探险吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"是啊……。要是能过上那样的生活，也许会很开心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""}]}